{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>In the matter</b> Two verses: \"and Rebecca was listening in the matter of Isaac to Esau his son,\" and the other: \"my kidneys will exult in the matter of your lips — equity.\" For she said to Jacob: my kidneys will exult if you speak equity to Isaac, so that he bless you." "<b>To hunt</b> in gematria equals גזל (robbery)." "<b>To bring</b> in gematria equals בגלוי (openly)."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:08.098308963Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}